message: >-
  If you use this software or data, please cite both the paper (preferred-citation)
  and the archived release (this record).
type: software
title: "bibojsa: group-velocity matching and photon-pair purity in BiB3O6"
abstract: >-
  Python package, survey data and figure sources for collinear spontaneous
  parametric down-conversion in the monoclinic biaxial crystal BiB3O6 (BIBO):
  Sellmeier dispersion, biaxial phase matching, point-group-2 effective
  nonlinearity, group-velocity-matching classification as level curves in pump
  wavelength, and joint-spectral-amplitude purity of heralded photons.
